VARIATION TWO:

In this version BLACK plays the first line of the verse, BLUE plays the second line, RED plays the  third line, and everyone plays the fourth line.  Then all three play the entire first verse together.  This repeats with the second verse.  Then all three play the bridge.  Next is a combined verse where BLACK plays the words from the first verse, BLUE plays the words from the second verse, and RED plays the bridge, all at the same time.  All three play the bridge again and then all three play a reprise of the first verse.


